# `mnmd <Tab>` completes mnmd's own subcommands, and nothing after them.

@root fixtures/demo-project
@shells bash zsh

-- empty line offers every subcommand
input:  "mnmd "
action: tab
expect:
filter
root
pack
check
install
completion

-- prefix narrows the subcommands
input:  mnmd fi
action: tab
expect: filter

-- nothing is completed beyond the subcommand slot
input:  "mnmd filter "
action: tab
expect:
